{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "73", "x": 0.904017983697097, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029725264906538765, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Let me tell you about my snorkelling trip that got canceled in Phuket last monsoon", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8262730292832798, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "season.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.08167922135988484, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I mean, my original plan was this meticulously organised 3-day island-hopping", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8268457336752335, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "adventure, complete with underwater photography sessions and sunset cruises.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8262511914681194, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Everything looked perfect, at least on paper.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.45668764122171607, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "To be honest, the first day was excellent-turquoise waters, powdery beaches,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8264895619857157, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everything went swimmingly. Unfortunately, on day two, Mother Nature threw a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8260296350429472, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "spanner in our plans. Out of nowhere, a tropical storm blew in - winds picking up", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8266916386696649, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like angry spirits, and then the rain started bucketing down mercilessly. Frankly,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8260552662813984, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the waves became wild horses galloping across the sea. At that point, our boat", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8261958279930648, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "captain called off everything, saying, \"It never rains but it pours\"-which, in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8267350067251243, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hindsight, was spot-on. I slumped into disappointment, staring at my futile", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8261754255272576, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "preparations. Had I known earlier, I'd have cancelled this trip altogether.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.7365203266486038, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Thankfully, here's the silver lining-our resort offered complimentary massage", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.8264286621631556, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "therapies. That said, the therapeutic experience proved magical, melting away", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "resentment like ice in sunshine. What's more, over ginger tea, I swapped stories", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8266570877602327, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with globetrotters whose adventures made mine pale in comparison.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.6982216175300446, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Now, while snorkelling remains firmly on my bucket list, this detour taught me", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8260771040965588, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "something crucial-life's best unplanned moments often arrive unexpectedly. In", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8262698510097118, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "other words, when Plan A sinks, Plan B may come to your rescue. Hopefully next", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.8260372218895288, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "time, I'll remember this lesson when travel plans go sideways.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.6304933254717199, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "part3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.06317436429146081, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, friends usually plan various leisure activities. They might go shopping,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.7657965322574775, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "watch movies, or plan weekend getaways and concert outings. On top of that, they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.8265420547620637, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}